        "app_name": "VR Basketball: Training Challenge",
        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "Step Into the Ultimate VR Basketball Experience! \nVR Basketball: Training Challenge is a VR experience designed to improve your basketball skills based on scientific principles. With advanced tracking systems, a realistic physics engine, and immersive gameplay, it brings the court to life. \n\nIn Training Mode, you can refine your shooting skills with structured stages such as 2-point, 3-point, and zigzag shots. Analyze your performance with advanced statistics and learn which areas of the court you're strongest in and which areas need improvement. With detailed statistical analysis, you can track your progress and understand how to improve over time. \n\nIn Challenge Mode, you compete freely against the clock. Each shot feels incredibly real, thanks to advanced sound design and a realistic physics engine. Different difficulty levels ensure that every game presents a unique challenge. \n\nThis game is also the perfect solution for exercising at home, combining fitness and fun to transform your living space into a high-tech basketball court. \n\nWith realistic physics, detailed performance analysis, and a scientifically grounded training methodology, VR Basketball: Training Challenge offers an experience that will take you to the top of the basketball world! Are you ready? ",
